hp-spectre-x360-16 (1.0.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release: depends on convertible-helper and convertible-power, and
    installs this laptop's TLP settings (powersave governor and the "cool"
    platform profile on battery, performance on AC).
  * The platform profile is set by a udev rule and a boot service, because
    hp-wmi's profile cannot be read back and TLP therefore ignores it.

 -- Bruce Perens <bruce@perens.com>  Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:00:00 -0700
